---
// src/pages/en/privacy-policy.astro
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const WEBSITE = "https://marilynmapabusiness.com";
const canonical = `${WEBSITE}/en/privacy-policy/`;
const title = "Privacy Policy | MAPA Business & Financial Services LLC";
const description = "Learn how MAPA Business & Financial Services LLC collects, uses, and protects your personal information. Updated privacy policy.";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  currentPath="/en/privacy-policy/"
>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/en/">Home</a>
    <span>›</span>
    <span>Privacy Policy</span>
  </div>

  <article class="article-container" style="max-width:820px;">
    <h1 class="article-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45); font-size:0.85rem; margin-bottom:30px;">Last updated: July 2026 · MAPA Business &amp; Financial Services LLC</p>

    <div class="article-body">
      <p>At <strong>MAPA Business &amp; Financial Services LLC</strong>, we respect and protect the privacy of those who visit our website and use our services. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and what your rights are.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect the following information when you visit our site or contact us:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact information:</strong> name, phone number, email address, and message when you complete the contact form.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage information:</strong> pages visited, time on site, traffic source. This information is collected in aggregate and anonymous form through Google Analytics.</li>
        <li><strong>WhatsApp information:</strong> when you start a WhatsApp conversation, the information you share is subject to WhatsApp/Meta's privacy policies.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>We use collected information solely to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to inquiries submitted through the contact form or WhatsApp.</li>
        <li>Improve the content and user experience of the website.</li>
        <li>Understand which services are of greatest interest to our visitors.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2>3. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
      <p>This site uses Google Analytics to analyze traffic anonymously. Google Analytics may use cookies to collect usage data. You can disable cookies in your browser settings or use the Google Analytics opt-out extension.</p>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>This site integrates the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>EmailJS:</strong> for contact form submissions.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Maps / Leaflet:</strong> to display our office location.</li>
        <li><strong>WhatsApp Business:</strong> for direct communication.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Fonts:</strong> for typography.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Each of these services has its own privacy policies, which we recommend you review.</p>

      <h2>5. Security</h2>
      <p>This site operates under the HTTPS protocol. We take reasonable measures to protect the information you share with us, although no internet transmission system is 100% secure.</p>

      <h2>6. Minors</h2>
      <p>This site is not directed to children under 13 years of age, and we do not intentionally collect information from minors.</p>

      <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>If you wish to access, correct, or delete information you have provided to us, please contact us:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Phone/WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="tel:+18626228339">(862) 622-8339</a></li>
        <li><strong>Address:</strong> 20 Bloomfield Pl, Newark, NJ 07104</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this privacy policy at any time. The "last updated" date at the top of this page reflects when the most recent changes were made.</p>

      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about this privacy policy, contact Marilyn Paladinez through the contact details indicated above, or visit us at our Newark, NJ office.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
